Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:02.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Global news in eighty\Nseconds.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Three verified updates,\Nchecked October
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}third.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}First, Eritrea has\Nsevered diplomatic
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.74,0:00:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}ties with Ethiopia after\NEthiopia
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}ordered its embassy in\NAsmara
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}closed.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.31,0:00:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Reuters reports that\NEthiopia also
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}told ten Eritrean\Ndiplomats to
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.51,0:00:20.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}leave within forty eight\Nhours.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The moves come amid\Nrenewed
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}fighting in northern\NEthiopia.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Second, western Europe\Nrecorded its
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}hottest summer, according\Nto a
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}new Copernicus review\Nreleased October
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}second.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.43,0:00:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Europe as a whole had
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.49,0:00:36.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}its third warmest summer.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.71,0:00:38.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Reuters reports that\Nfifty two
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.50,0:00:39.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}percent of the continent\Nhad
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}faced very strong heat\Nstress
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}by the end of summer.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.59,0:00:46.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}That figure describes\Naffected land,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.13,0:00:47.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}rather than a count of
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}people harmed.
