Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.29,0:00:53.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the International Space\NStation aboard
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.19,0:00:55.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}SpaceX's Crew Thirteen\Nmission.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.87,0:00:57.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}NASA confirms Dragon\Ndocked on
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.64,0:01:00.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}October first, Eastern\Ntime, after
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.57,0:01:02.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}a flight lasting seven\Nhours
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.08,0:01:04.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}and fifty five minutes.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.24,0:01:05.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The agency calls it the
